  "$comment": "NBA baseline metrics for simulation realism auditing. Sources: NBA.com/stats, Basketball-Reference, Second Spectrum tracking data, Synergy Sports. Ranges are league-wide 2015-2024 unless noted. These are DIAGNOSTIC bands, not hard targets — use them to find anomalies, not to force-fit. Era matters: pace and 3PA have trended up; use the modern (2020+) band when in doubt.",
